+ * OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF
+ * SUCH DAMAGE.
+ *
+ * Author:  Bojan Zivkovic (bojan@mips.com)
+ *
+ * IIR filter optimized for MIPS floating-point architecture
